  "prefLabel": "Arch 304.01 Endorsement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arch 304.01 Endorsement. Applicants who are licensed in another jurisdiction with substantially similar requirements to New Hampshire as stated in Plc 313.16, and who seek licensure based on endorsement shall apply for licensure as required by Plc 304.01 through Plc 304.05.\n\nSource. #3029, eff 5-28-85; ss by #4599, eff 4-13-89, EXPIRED: 4-13-95\n\nNew. #7944, eff 8-27-03; ss by #9097, eff 2-29-08; ss by #10904, eff 8-5-15; ss by #12847, eff 8-14-19; ss by #13362, eff 4-6-22; ss by #14553, eff 6-2-26, EXPIRES: 6-2-36",
